[{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0012","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0010","text":"那个，不好意思……\n能打扰一下吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0000","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0020","text":"……好的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0001","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0030","text":"────哎呀，这不是SHHis的绯田美琴吗！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0040","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0002","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0050","text":"哇——比视频里看到的还要\n高挑好多啊……！脸好小——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0003","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0060","text":"而且怎么说呢……气场好强────"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0070","text":"……那个，您认识我啊"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0004","text":"芙瓦奇丝2"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0080","text":"何止认识……\n这孩子，她们母女俩都是SHHis的粉丝呢——"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0005","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0090","text":"是的！\n我和女儿一起支持你们！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0100","text":"原来是这样啊……\n谢谢你们"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0006","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0110","text":"那个……\n能给我签个名吗！！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0120","text":"好的\n没问题"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0007","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0130","text":"哇——\n太感谢了——！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0008","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0140","text":"那个，今天日花小姐没有一起来吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0150","text":"不，一起来的"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0160","text":"……！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0161","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0162","text":"Motion"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0170","text":"你、你好……"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0009","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0180","text":"哇——是本人！"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0011","text":"芙瓦奇丝1"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0190","text":"那个……\n日花小姐也能给我签个名吗？"},{"key":"SCENARIO_s42_01070200_03_0200","text":"好的……\n可以哦"}]
